        "githubCommitMessage": "fix(prompt-hub): harden dedupe-retry parse — replacer fn + key-name dedupe\n\nReview findings on the retry path: (1) String.replace with a string\nreplacement treats $&, $$, $' in frontmatter as special patterns and\ncorrupts the document — use a replacer function; (2) dedupe by top-level\nkey name instead of exact line so value/whitespace-differing duplicates\nare also rescued, while indented keys are left alone (repeated nested\nfields across parents are legitimate YAML).\n\nVerified: duplicate-key rescue, $&-content safety, first-occurrence-wins,\nnested-key preservation — all pass; tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
